        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cluain Na Sidhe, Killashee, Co.Longford, a modern and well-maintained development of quality homes.\r\nNo.49 is a four bed semi-detached property extending to 124 sq.mtrs. (1334 sq.ft.).\r\nAccommodation Includes  ;\r\nEntrance hall  :  2.3 x 5.5  Laminate flooring.\r\nLiving room  :  4.6 x 4.4. Laminate flooring, open fireplace with solid fuel stove, bay window, double doors to dining area.\r\nKitchen / Dining  :  3.9 x 5.1. Fitted units, tiled floor.\r\nUtility  :  1.7 x 2.1.  Fitted units, tiled floor.\r\nW.C. :  1.7 X 1.6. Cistern, basin & pedestal.\r\nSunroom  :  3.9 x 3.8. Additional timber frame structure to rear, metal sheeted roof, Perspex sheeting.  Not a permanent structure or included as living space.\r\nBedroom 1.  :  3.8 x 2.9.  Carpet.\r\nEn-suite  :  2.6 x 0.8.  Wall & floor tiling, electric shower.  \r\nBedroom 2.  :  2.9 x 3.1.  Carpet.\r\nBedroom 3.  :  2.5 x 3.9.  Carpet, Sliderobe.\r\nBedroom 4.  :  3.5 x 2.0 + wardrobe space 0.8 x 1.6\r\nBathroom  :  2.6 x 1.6.  Wall & floor tiling, Bath.   \r\n\r\nOutside  :  Open drive and grass area to front, enclosed garden with garden shed to rear.\r\n\r\nServices  :  Mains water & sewerage, ESB supply, Oil fired heating.\r\n\r\nThis property is presented in “Walk-in” condition and ready to welcome it’s new owner.\r\nThe Cluain Na Sidhe development is within walking distance of the village. The local primary school and Royal Canal are on your doorstep. This is a house that ticks many boxes, it may well be the one you were waiting for. To arrange your viewing, Contact John, 043 3341176 or 086 8346559 at any time."
      },
